{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773170981,"nonce":"4HQi35Zfa2Pf8EUhIKQOPHlSFlk=","title":"enterSubgraph re-derives ports on cached subgraph, corrupting user binding edits","message":"deriveSubgraphPorts is called on every re-entry to a composite node, including when a cachedGraph is present. This silently rewrites input_bindings/output_bindings/input_ports/output_ports on each re-entry, discarding any binding customizations the user made inside the subgraph. Fix: only call deriveSubgraphPorts when creating a fresh subgraph (factory or template_graph path); use the cached graph as-is on subsequent entries.","files":null}]}